    <string name="connect_title">How to connect the board</string>
    <string name="connect_body">1. This is your personal board. Its key is below.\n2. Paste the same key on the PC (menu ⋯ → Settings) or on the phone (long-press the title) — both devices show one board.\n3. Your AI fills it with POST /api/b/add?b=KEY (title, note, status, progress). Tabs: POST /api/b/section/add?b=KEY.\n4. Data travels through the website, so it works on any network, not only at home.</string>
